217 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (A Heterogeneous Condition Much like other neurodivergent conditions, ADHD presents uniquely in each person. One individual might struggle significantly with time management but excel in creativity and problem-solving, while another might have difficulties with impulsivity but thrive in high-energy environments. Recognising and understanding these traits on a personal level is crucial for providing tailored support that honours both strengths and challenges, helping create an environment where individuals with ADHD can succeed and thrive.)
/E (A Heterogeneous Condition Much like other neurodivergent conditions, ADHD presents uniquely in each person. One individual might struggle significantly with time management but excel in creativity and problem-solving, while another might have difficulties with impulsivity but thrive in high-energy environments. Recognising and understanding these traits on a personal level is crucial for providing tailored support that honours both strengths and challenges, helping create an environment where individuals with ADHD can succeed and thrive.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
