231 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (The use of the term "disorder" in ADHD is debated, with some supporting it for its medical accuracy, ability to validate challenges, and ensure access to support and research, while others criticise it for perpetuating stigma and pathologising natural cognitive differences.)
